// Engine Sim V0.1.14A
// 1938 Packard 245 100 @ 3600
// Created by oror 2026

// Packard
// Six, Series 1600 — 1938
// Six, Series 1700 — 1939
// One-Ten, Series 1800 — 1940
// One-Ten, Series 1900 — 1941
// Six / Custom Six, Series 2000, 2010, 2020 and 2030 — 1942
// Clipper Six, Series 2100 — 1946–1947
// Six, Series 2220 and 2240 (taxi/export only) — 1948–1949

// 1948 Packard Clipper Six L.A. Noire

